ic polls date to May and showed Moskowitz ahead by double digits, but they predate the general-election campaign against Singer. The contest has drawn national attention, with party leaders visiting South Florida battleground seats, and immigration and gun policy have featured prominently. The race expects Moskowitz to win by a modest margin, with enough uncertainty that an upset remains plausible.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7798, "margin": 4.68}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7278, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7527, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7814, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.71, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7118, "margin": 4.3}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7713, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7678, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.7642, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8024, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.7788, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.7649, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7775, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.7349, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.7363, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.7323, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.7881, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.74, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.7814, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.758, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.8044, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.7565, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.7661, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.755, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.7828, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.7902, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.7844, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.7962, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-20"